1
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,200
Your Highness.

2
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:24,760
Please.

3
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,080
It's been years since we last met.

4
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,480
This fine wine of Kuizhou

5
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,520
is something I've been yearning for.

6
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,000
Refreshing.

7
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:46,120
It seems the fine wine and beauties here

8
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,800
are both to Your Highness's liking.

9
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,320
Xin'er

10
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,450
is a generous gift bestowed upon me by you, Madam.

11
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,640
How could I not love her?

12
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,640
After so many years,

13
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:06,460
Xin'er has grown even more graceful and poised.

14
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,600
In Quantan,

15
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,400
is everything well?

16
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:12,520
Thanks to your blessing, Madam,

17
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:13,840
Xin'er is doing well.

18
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,440
His Highness

19
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,080
treats Xin'er well too.

20
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:20,200
For him to bring you back to visit your family

21
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,480
shows he cares deeply.

22
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:24,240
You must serve him with all your heart.

23
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,600
Xin'er understands.

24
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,440
Xin'er,

25
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:41,900
I remember you practicing swordplay since childhood,

26
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,240
learning the true essence from General Ye.

27
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:46,170
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

28
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:48,979
Why not perform a sword dance behind the screen?

29
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:51,039
It observes the etiquette of ladies

30
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,920
and lets everyone witness

31
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:55,090
the grace of a general's daughter.

32
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:59,039
Someone, bring a sword.

33
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,400
Madam,

34
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,680
I've been married in Quantan for years.

35
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,240
My wrist strength is not what it used to be.

36
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:04,640
I'm afraid...

37
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,520
What?

38
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,920
Are my orders

39
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,440
unworthy of your noble status now?

40
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,720
Xin'er,

41
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,840
since Madam wishes to see it,

42
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,880
just perform a dance.

43
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,160
Yes.

44
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,329
My hand slipped.

45
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,880
I didn't mean it.

46
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,320
Please forgive me, Madam.

47
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,120
Insolent!

48
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:02,000
Kuizhou puts etiquette first,

49
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,600
valuing propriety and rules above all.

50
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,280
How dare you lose your manners so?

51
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,740
Please forgive me, Madam.

52
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:11,400
It is my shame.

53
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,440
This girl

54
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,560
was raised in the Governor's Mansion since childhood.

55
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:17,079
I treated her as my own.

56
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,240
I failed to discipline her well.

57
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,840
But if word of today's incident gets out,

58
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,320
won't everyone think

59
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,840
I indulge my children in disrespecting

60
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,600
our diplomatic ties with Quantan?

61
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,840
How will I face the people of Kuizhou?

62
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,840
Yi'er,

63
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,720
don't you think so?

64
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,640
You are absolutely right, Mother.

65
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:52,440
Since Lady Ye received Kuizhou's teachings from a young age,

66
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,770
she should abide by Kuizhou's etiquette.

67
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,280
What does Your Highness think?

68
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,440
Madam has always governed her household strictly.

69
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,900
How she should be punished

70
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:03,560
is up to you.

71
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:05,720
In that case...

72
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:06,880
Wait, Madam.

73
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,560
Please see clearly, Madam.

74
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:14,240
Madam Ye dropping her sword was no accident.

75
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,360
It was the Sword-Breaking Rite.

76
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:19,200
Years ago, when General Ye was trapped in Cangyan Valley,

77
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:21,720
his three thousand naval troops ran out of arrows and rations.

78
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,280
The soldiers broke their arrows

79
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,540
to show their resolve.

80
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,640
They were willing to shatter their weapons for a wise ruler,

81
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,720
vowing no more wars on the Kui River.

82
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,960
Madam Ye's gesture today meant to tell everyone

83
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:34,400
that Kuizhou not only has brave men,

84
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,100
but women also possess loyalty and courage.

85
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,490
Everyone in Kuizhou

86
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:41,010
is the subject of the Commander and Madam.

87
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,680
We are willing to be the sword in life

88
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,920
and the blade in death,

89
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,720
swearing to protect Kuizhou's peace to the death.

90
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,960
I am dull-witted.

91
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,520
I only use this sword rite

92
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:53,080
to pray for Kuizhou's eternal peace.

93
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,560
Mother.

94
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,040
Please allow me to speak, Mother.

95
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,040
What I did today

96
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,360
was also for the face of all of Kuizhou.

97
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,400
Madam Ye, she...

98
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,720
The face of Kuizhou...

99
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:14,240
Is that something you are worthy to consider?

100
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,640
The Rules of Appearance for the Guilty.

101
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,300
Could it be you've forgotten?

102
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:18,280
Recite it.

103
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,560
Yes.

104
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:25,600
Whenever titled ladies enter to serve,

105
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:28,280
they must be measured by the etiquette officer.

106
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:30,600
Arms must not exceed a foot in circumference.

107
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,200
Waist must not exceed four spans.

108
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:32,960
Weight

109
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,080
under a hundred catties.

110
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,280
Those who fail cannot serve at banquets in the front hall,

111
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:40,600
but are confined to menial tasks in the rear pavilion.

112
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:43,400
A register for the thin is established in Kuizhou.

113
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,880
Anyone registered

114
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,580
is only allowed to work

115
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,840
as a washerwoman,

116
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:51,040
kitchen maid, or other menial jobs.

117
00:05:51,159 --> 00:05:53,020
It is strictly forbidden to study

118
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:55,060
poetry, books, dance, and music.

119
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,440
Those who secretly hoard musical instruments

120
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,040
will have their strings cut.

121
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,810
Those who secretly study poetry and books

122
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,400
will receive twenty strokes with a cane.

123
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:06,520
Since you remember it so clearly,

124
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,820
why did you knowingly violate it?

125
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,560
If I don't punish you today,

126
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,380
how can I convince the public?

127
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,400
Whether you can recite it or not today,

128
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:16,080
you will be punished.

129
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,600
Third Young Master.

130
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,960
Madam is furious right now.

131
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:21,880
If you go in now,

132
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,160
it will be like adding oil to the fire.

133
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,840
Step aside.

134
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,520
Third Young Master.

135
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:28,280
Fang Zhuozhuo repeatedly violated the Rules of Appearance for the Guilty.

136
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,960
Drag her down and give her twenty strokes.

137
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:31,880
Wait.

138
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:36,200
Forgive me, Madam.

139
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:38,080
I couldn't stop the Third Young Master.

140
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,200
Mother, please see clearly.

141
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,480
I boldly speak the truth.

142
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,740
Years ago, for the stability of Kuizhou,

143
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,040
Mother arranged for Lady Ye to marry far away.

144
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,770
What great foresight that was.

145
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,360
And now,

146
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,040
what Fang did

147
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,159
was also for the greater good

148
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:51,290
and for you, Mother.

149
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,159
She had no intention of offending you.

150
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,600
Every word you say

151
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,980
brings up my decision from back then.

152
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,159
What?

153
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:01,440
Do you think I was wrong back then,

154
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:04,440
or do you think I am now senile,

155
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:07,080
and unable to read the hearts of those around me?

156
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,480
I have no such intention.

157
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,080
Very well.

158
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,560
I will deal with her today.

159
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,400
I want to see

160
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:17,440
what my good son, whom I've taught all these years,

161
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,200
will do.

162
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,560
Men, drag her away.

163
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,680
Mother, please think twice.

164
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,160
Mother.

165
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,040
Recently, I

166
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,040
have been compiling a book

167
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,760
on the cultivation of Qionghua.

168
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,880
It contains my experience on cultivating Qionghua.

169
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:30,280
I...

170
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:30,800
Hold her down.

171
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,460
I'm willing to offer it to you.

172
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,080
Let me go.

173
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,320
Stop.

174
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,480
Chu Shengyi,

175
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,260
how dare you use force in Qiwu Courtyard!

176
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,570
If you insist on punishing her,

177
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,840
I am willing to take it for her.

178
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,320
Please let Lady Fang go.

179
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:03,560
Fine.

180
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:09,300
Since our Third Young Master is so affectionate and loyal,

181
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,080
I will grant your wish.

182
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:14,080
Lady Fang repeatedly commits offenses and needs discipline.

183
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:17,880
It's the Third Young Master's failure to discipline his household.

184
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,040
Drag the Third Young Master away,

185
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,720
and give him twenty strokes.

186
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,000
Beat him hard.

187
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,320
The reason Lady Li persecutes Ye Xin

188
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,799
is because she is very important to you.

189
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,600
Then we will do the opposite.

190
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:36,600
Make Lady Li

191
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,559
feel that you don't care about Ye Xin anymore.

192
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,360
To save her,

193
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,299
it will be much easier.

194
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,799
But if so,

195
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,130
you won't escape a beating.

196
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,170
It's just a few strokes.

197
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,720
It won't cost my life.

198
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,240
I can bear it.

199
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,200
Beat him.

200
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,360
Chu Shengyi,

201
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,170
you had already planned

202
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,970
to take this punishment for me.

203
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,080
What?

204
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,130
Trying to get reinforcements?

205
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:46,370
Disciplining a son in Qiwu Courtyard,

206
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,320
even if the Governor comes,

207
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,200
he can't say anything.

208
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,160
Don't move.

209
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,200
Chu Shengyi,

210
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,300
you have to hold on.

211
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,570
Ye Xin is still waiting for you.

212
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,010
Return to the manor.

213
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,920
Return to the manor.

214
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,080
Okay.

215
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,530
Return to the manor.

216
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,040
Momo.

217
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,160
Don't you think

218
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,360
our Third Young Master

219
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:34,840
is a bit off today?

220
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,200
I also find it strange.

221
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:41,440
The Third Young Master has been in Qiwu Courtyard all these years,

222
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,840
always obedient.

223
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:46,280
But today he lost his composure over a flower slave.

224
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,000
At the banquet today,

225
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,530
I purposely tested him with Ye Xin,

226
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,360
and he kept his cool.

227
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:58,040
But when something happened to that flower slave,

228
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,720
he became so nervous.

229
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,360
Even that deadly punishment,

230
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:04,080
he volunteered to take it.

231
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,520
Do you think, Madam,

232
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:08,600
that the Third Young Master has had a change of heart?

233
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,040
How is that possible?

234
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,600
People,

235
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:13,040
when their lives are on the line,

236
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:15,240
can hardly hide their true intentions.

237
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:18,240
Go prepare some medicine for wounds

238
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,400
and take it to the Young Master's mansion.

239
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:22,120
Take a good look for me.

240
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,320
I understand.

241
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,680
You care about your son, Madam.
